    "name": "Tiny Company",
    "steam_appid": 3786150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/ba2e04333841a1e376a92d9e57943d19.avif?t=1755690256\" width=800 height=301 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/d5e86ce5cc84189aa8251742701a7455.avif?t=1755690256\" width=347 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tiny Company</strong>, you are the owner of a cozy little shop that specializes in creating custom terrariums. But unlike most stores, your clients are not people \u2014 they\u2019re the actual future inhabitants of the terrariums! From ants and beetles to snakes, geckos, mantises, snails, and more, each visitor arrives with a specific vision for their terrarium dream home, and it\u2019s your job to bring it to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/c193fb14280bc2463d5e8cca65769ddc.poster.avif?t=1755690256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/c193fb14280bc2463d5e8cca65769ddc.webm?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/c193fb14280bc2463d5e8cca65769ddc.mp4?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/be20df6187128ba70a6c654a0c5a4df6.avif?t=1755690256\" width=280 height=45 /></span><br>There are going to be 3 different game modes you can choose from and have lots of fun:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>STORY Mode</strong> <br>Each client comes in person to your shop, greets you with a short dialogue, and provides a reference photo of the terrarium they\u2019d like you to build. You must recreate their desired terrarium layout using the decorative elements available in your shop. Try to match the reference as closely as possible to get the highest score, trigger unique dialogue reactions, or unlock the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>DAILY Mode</strong> <br>In this mode, you\u2019ll receive orders online as daily challenges. Complete them to maintain your track record and hold your place  or advance  on the leaderboard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>ENDLESS Mode</strong> <br>Here, you\u2019ll keep receiving online orders and can complete as many as you like. Have fun, get creative, and design countless unique terrariums. This mode also features a scoring system to help you compete for a top spot on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/322843a97ff63290f7f30368cde27d6d.poster.avif?t=1755690256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/322843a97ff63290f7f30368cde27d6d.webm?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/322843a97ff63290f7f30368cde27d6d.mp4?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/015a122d37e8316d50bc4e1c1cc68386.avif?t=1755690256\" width=217 height=44 /></span><br>Using your mouse, click on boxes, sacks, or piles of sticks to drop items onto the counter. Then, pick up each item, hover it over the terrarium to position it, and let it drop inside. <br>But there\u2019s a catch: once you place an object, you can\u2019t move it again. Also, items may have different properties, making interactions more fun and slightly more challenging.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/393349323621c2f4c97a5cbd19a943db.avif?t=1755690256\" width=275 height=45 /></span><br>In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, after completing a terrarium, your design is evaluated for accuracy and creativity, with a final score between <strong>0 and 3 stars</strong>. Depending on how well you\u2019ve captured the client\u2019s vision, their reactions will vary, sometimes sweet, sometimes disappointed. <br>As you earn stars, you\u2019ll unlock new levels with different creatures, each presenting fresh decorative challenges. You can always revisit previous levels to aim for a better score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Daily</strong> and <strong>Endless</strong> modes, the gameplay remains the same, but the scoring system is different: you earn points that let you compete against other players for a place on the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.poster.avif?t=1755690256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.webm?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.mp4?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/bcbd710c81e919eb1adf940a702925d4.avif?t=1755690256\" width=490 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>official Discord server</strong> to connect with other players, suggest new ideas, report bugs, or just chat with a great group of people.</p>",
