ch item, hover it over the terrarium to position it, and let it drop inside. <br>But there\u2019s a catch: once you place an object, you can\u2019t move it again. Also, items may have different properties, making interactions more fun and slightly more challenging.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/393349323621c2f4c97a5cbd19a943db.avif?t=1755690256\" width=275 height=45 /></span><br>In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, after completing a terrarium, your design is evaluated for accuracy and creativity, with a final score between <strong>0 and 3 stars</strong>. Depending on how well you\u2019ve captured the client\u2019s vision, their reactions will vary, sometimes sweet, sometimes disappointed. <br>As you earn stars, you\u2019ll unlock new levels with different creatures, each presenting fresh decorative challenges. You can always revisit previous levels to aim for a better score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Daily</strong> and <strong>Endless</strong> modes, the gameplay remains the same, but the scoring system is different: you earn points that let you compete against other players for a place on the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.poster.avif?t=1755690256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.webm?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/195124e900b1f97b0d6cb1c381121b4b.mp4?t=1755690256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786150/extras/bcbd710c81e919eb1adf940a702925d4.avif?t=1755690256\" width=490 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>official Discord server</strong> to connect with other players, suggest new ideas, report bugs, or just chat with a great group of people.</p>",
